      "expected": "The specification states that T3, an AON6407 MOSFET, is the ATO solenoid-valve low-side switch driving the ATO_VALVE net, with gate drive through R10 and pre-drive by T4.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "schematic",
          "quote": "Sheet 1/3 ATO Valve tile: ATO_VALVE -> R10 100Ω -> gate of T5 A03400A; T5 switches the ATO valve load"
