        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "T3 — AON6407 (8-DFN N-MOSFET) | ATO solenoid-valve low-side switch | Netlist: drives ATO_VALVE net; gate driven through R10 (100 Ω), pre-driven via T4 (BT3904)."
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The ATO valve is switched by a different MOSFET type than intended. If the AO3400A has lower current, thermal, or safe-operating-area margin than the specified AON6407, the valve driver could overheat, fail to switch reliably, or be damaged under solenoid inductive load.",
